"Diagnostic timing can lower FPS; leave off for normal play." = "诊断计时可能降低帧率，正常游玩时请关闭。";

/* Metal optimization controls and measured status. */
"Two-level GPU address table" = "两级 GPU 地址表";
"Skip loading attachments before a full clear" = "完整清除前不加载旧附件";
"Skip loading fully overwritten copy targets" = "完整覆盖复制前不加载旧目标";
"Clear the existing scene copy directly" = "直接清除现有场景副本";
"Inline strict vertex math" = "内联严格顶点运算";
"Preserve scene-texture compression eligibility" = "保留场景纹理的无损压缩条件";
"Merge MetalFX alpha upscaling" = "合并 MetalFX Alpha 放大";
"Reclaim idle staging backing" = "回收闲置暂存内存";
"Release the startup compilation archive" = "释放启动预热存档对象";
"Batch color attachment clears" = "批量清除颜色附件";
"Copy directly from the existing scene copy" = "直接从现有场景副本复制";
"Fit GPU staging allocations to requests" = "按需匹配 GPU 暂存分配";
"Write textures directly to tiled game memory" = "纹理直接写入游戏平铺内存";
"Declare precise resource residency" = "精确声明资源驻留";
"Coalesce compatible resource barriers" = "合并兼容的资源屏障";
"Keep occlusion query compute work together" = "连续执行遮挡查询计算";
"Use precise residency for direct compute" = "直接绑定计算使用精确驻留";
"Tile directly from half-size scene copies" = "直接从半尺寸场景副本平铺";
"Fold compatible pending clears" = "合并兼容的待执行清除";
"Specialize fragment parameter reads" = "片元参数读取专用化";
"Write small parameters with a compute kernel" = "用计算内核写入小参数";
"Use relaxed fragment and compute math" = "片元与计算采用宽松浮点运算";
"Save and load binary pipeline archives" = "保存并加载二进制管线归档";
"Saves about 0.9 GiB versus the flat table. Switching rebuilds the shader cache." = "相比平铺地址表约节省 0.9 GiB。切换后会重建着色器缓存。";
"Keeps the clear result while avoiding an unnecessary previous-content load." = "保留清除结果，省去对旧内容的不必要加载。";
"Only discards previous contents when the copy replaces the complete target." = "仅在复制完整覆盖目标时，才丢弃目标原来的内容。";
"Avoids a native-resolution round trip. About 5% faster in the earlier matched scene test." = "省去一次原生分辨率往返。此前同场景对照约提升 5%。";
"Retains explicit FMA and rounding rules. Adopted after correctness checks and scene comparisons." = "保留显式 FMA 和舍入规则；通过正确性检查与场景对照后采用。";
"Avoids unused format-view capabilities; real format reinterpretation retains its original path." = "省去未使用的格式视图能力；确实需要格式重解释的资源仍走原路径。";
"Removes a separate alpha enlargement copy on the MetalFX path without changing output resolution." = "在 MetalFX 路径省去单独的 Alpha 放大复制，不改变输出分辨率。";
"Reclaims only completed, idle backing. Pool capacities and reusable objects are retained." = "只回收 GPU 已完成且闲置的底层内存，保留池容量和可复用对象。";
"Drops the compilation-only object after prewarm while retaining all active pipelines." = "预热后释放仅用于编译的对象，保留全部活动管线。";
"Combines compatible clears; uncertain cases keep separate operations." = "合并兼容的清除操作；不确定的情况仍分别执行。";
"Avoids materializing an intermediate native texture when the complete copy is equivalent." = "完整复制等价时，省去中间原生纹理的实体化。";
"Reduces rounding waste in new GPU-only blocks without reducing retained byte budgets." = "减少新建 GPU 暂存块的取整浪费，不缩小保留字节预算。";
"Combines texture reading and PS4 tiling for supported formats; others retain the original path." = "对支持的格式合并纹理读取与 PS4 平铺；其他格式保留原实现。";
"Narrows declarations only for resources whose bindings are known; unknown cases remain conservative." = "仅缩小绑定已知资源的声明范围；未知情况仍采用保守覆盖。";
"Avoids redundant dependency boundaries while retaining required synchronization." = "省去冗余依赖边界，保留必要的同步。";
"Reduces compatible compute encoder transitions while retaining query ordering." = "减少兼容计算编码器之间的切换，保留查询顺序。";
"Applies only to verified direct bindings; pointer-based and unknown workloads retain full coverage." = "仅适用于确认过的直接绑定；指针访问与未知任务仍保留完整覆盖。";
"Uses the same nearest resolve and tiling result, avoiding an intermediate full-size copy." = "保持原有最近邻还原与平铺结果，省去中间全尺寸副本。";
"Adopted by choice despite noisy isolated FPS; the safe full-surface fallback remains." = "尽管单项帧率波动较大，仍按你的选择采用；保留安全的完整表面回退。";
"Correctness tested, but repeatable gameplay benefit is unconfirmed; may increase compilation or resource overhead." = "帧率收益未确认，可能增加编译或资源开销。";
"Removes tiny buffer copies, but adds compute transitions. No repeatable FPS gain; memory was about 37 MiB higher in one comparison." = "帧率收益未确认；一次对照中多用约 37 MiB 内存。";
"V2 float profile: benefit is unconfirmed and floating-point results may change. Switching rebuilds the shader cache." = "可能改变浮点结果，收益未确认；切换后需重建着色器。";
"Earlier archive loading used about 0.6 GiB more process memory. Default off; turning off ignores existing archive files without deleting them." = "此前加载时多用约 0.6 GiB 内存；关闭后忽略归档文件，保留文件。";
