"Adopted optimizations (default on)" = "默认开启";
"Some options were accepted as a bundle; individual FPS gains are not established." = "部分选项以组合方式验证并采用，尚不能确认每一项各自的帧率收益。";
"Experimental optimizations (default off)" = "可选实验";
