"Restore recommended optimization defaults" = "恢复建议的优化默认值";
"These controls target the bundled Metal engine and override matching developer environment entries. Quicksave, saves and game-quality settings are retained." = "这些选项用于内置 Metal 引擎，并优先于开发者环境变量中的同名设置；不会重置快速存档、存档和画质设置。";
