"Reuse cross-chunk reads within one draw" = "复用跨块读取快照";
"Reuses complete or contained read snapshots within one draw or dispatch. Writes, mapping changes and ring wrap invalidate them. No extra GPU buffers; FPS benefit is not established." = "复用单次绘制内的读取快照，写入后失效。不增加 GPU 缓冲；帧率收益未确认。";

"Reclaim invalid sampled textures" = "回收失效采样纹理";

"Reclaims idle CPU-invalid sampled copies after GPU completion. Valid caches and their capacities are retained." = "GPU 完成使用后，回收闲置且因 CPU 写入而失效的副本；保留有效缓存与缓存容量。";

